{"title":"Gem Onyx","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Bogling, Ogre Elder, Dune Skirmisher, Orc Grunt</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (2 / 1,998 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - Normal, 0.0% of recorded drops (1 / 3,010 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.0%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (1 / 419 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-grunt\" title=\"Orc Grunt - Normal, 0.6% of recorded drops (1 / 163 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9c694d24818e1e184cda.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Grunt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.6%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-onyx\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>42</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1\">1c <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2\">2c <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3\">3c</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4\">4c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Onyx found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Brawler)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>42 <span class=\"muted\">(58%)</span></td><td>62%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Brawler: ≈0.75% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>11 <span class=\"muted\">(15%)</span></td><td>17%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Brawler: 2% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>11 <span class=\"muted\">(15%)</span></td><td>9.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Brawler: ≈2.25% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>5 <span class=\"muted\">(6.9%)</span></td><td>6.5%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c)</td><td>Brawler: 3% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(2.8%)</span></td><td>2.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Brawler: ≈3.75% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>1.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Brawler: 5% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(1.4%)</span></td><td>1.4%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Brawler: ≈5.25% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Brawler: 6% more melee damage dealt</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">72 Onyx recorded: 71 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 630 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-superior\"><img src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"Gem Onyx\"></div><h3>Gem Onyx <span class=\"q-name q-superior\">(3.5c)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n